@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
title Login and role-based navigation
autonumber
participant "User" as U
participant "LoginPage / LoginCubit" as UI
participant "Auth domain use cases" as D
participant "AuthRepositoryImpl / FirebaseAuthDataSource" as R
participant "Firebase Authentication" as A
participant "SessionController / AppSession / Router" as S
participant "GetUserProfile / Profile repository + data source" as P
participant "Cloud Firestore" as F
note over U, F: Domain use cases depend on repository interfaces; concrete data implementations are injected.
U -> UI: Submit email and password
UI -> UI: Emit LoginSubmitting; show loading
UI -> D: SignInWithEmail(SignInParams)
alt Empty email or password
D --> UI: Failure(InvalidCredentialsFailure); show message
else Nonempty credentials (email is trimmed)
D -> R: signInWithEmail(email, password)
R -> A: signInWithEmailAndPassword
alt Authentication fails
A --> R: Firebase error (credentials / disabled / network / rate limit)
R --> D: Failure(AppFailure), no raw exception
D --> UI: Failure; emit LoginFailure and show message
else Authentication succeeds
A --> R: UserCredential
R --> D: Success(AuthUser)
D --> UI: Success; emit LoginSuccess (no navigation here)
end
end
group Independent auth-state subscription, established at startup
A -> R: authStateChanges emits signed-in user
R -> D: Mapped AuthUser through WatchAuthState
D -> S: Auth-state event
S -> S: setLoading; router shows splash
S -> P: GetUserProfile(user.id) via repository interface
P -> F: Read users/{uid}
F --> P: Profile document or read error
alt Valid profile; this auth event is still current
P --> S: Success(UserProfile)
S -> S: setSignedIn with profile role; refresh router
S -> U: Open student, professor, or admin home
else Missing / invalid profile or read failure
P --> S: Failure(AppFailure)
S -> S: setSignedOut(errorMessage); return to login
S -> D: SignOut(NoParams)
D -> R: signOut()
R -> A: signOut()
end
end
note over U, F: Auth events may arrive before sign-in returns. Stale profile loads are ignored; signed-out events preserve the error message.
@enduml
